---
globs: **/*.css, **/*.scss, **/*.vue
alwaysApply: false
---

Applies to `.vue` files only within `<style>` blocks.

Casing:
- Use `kebab-case` for classes, custom properties, keyframes, Sass variables and stylesheet files

Files:
- Name the base, components and tokens files after their tier, and each page file after its page: `account-settings.css`, `base.css`, `tokens.css`

Classes:
- Use BEM, joining an element with `__` and a modifier with `--`: `.search-bar`, `.search-bar__input`, `.search-bar__input--large`
- Name an element after its block alone, even inside another element: `.card__title`, not `.card__header__title`
- Name a modifier with its value alone: `.button--large`, not `.button--size-large`
- Name a state class with an adjective attached to its block or element: `.tab.active`
- Use classes outside BEM only for states and `.hidden`

Custom properties:
- Beyond core naming's abbreviations, abbreviate only size suffixes: `--color-background-*`, not `--color-bg-*`
- Use these size suffixes, smallest to largest: `3xs` and down, `2xs`, `xs`, `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl`, `2xl`, `3xl` and up
- Name palette colors `--color-<hue>-<shade>` after their look, never their use, with shades `50`, `100` to `900` in steps of 100, and `950`: `--color-blue-500`, `--color-neutral-900`
- Name opaque black and white `--color-black` and `--color-white`, and translucent ones `--color-<black|white>-alpha-<opacity percentage>`: `--color-black-alpha-40`, `--color-white`, `--color-white-alpha-8`
- Name font stacks `--font-family-<use>`: `--font-family-body`, `--font-family-code`
- Name spacing `--space-<n>`, with n an integer and a value of n × 4px: `--space-2`, `--space-4`
- Name the duration, font size, radius and shadow scales `--<scale>-<size>`: `--duration-sm`, `--radius-md`, `--shadow-lg`
- Name semantic colors `--color-<target>-<role>[-<state>]` after their use, never their look, with `background`, `border` or `text` as target, a meaning as role (`default`, `muted`, `warning`), and the pseudo-class or attribute it styles as state (`disabled`, `hover`): `--color-background-warning`, `--color-border-default-hover`, `--color-text-muted`
- Name z-index tokens `--z-index-<layer>`: `--z-index-dropdown`, `--z-index-modal`
- Name component and local custom properties `--<block>-<css-property>`: `--button-height`, `--card-padding`

Keyframes:
- Name keyframes `<block>-<motion>`: `spinner-rotate`, `toast-slide-in`; name shared keyframes `<motion>`: `fade-in`

Sass variables (in `.scss` files and `lang="scss"` blocks):
- Name breakpoint variables `$breakpoint-<size>`: `$breakpoint-md`

Injected stylesheets (into a page you do not own):
- Prefix every class, custom property and keyframe with a short project prefix: `.acme-card__title`, `--acme-space-4`
